PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, May to June, August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 147% of normal in May to June and 39% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1952, with grid 14559 at 61% that year.</p>"}
